      "body": "- [x] I, the PR author, have personally reviewed every line of this PR.\n\n# What does this PR do?\nMake TrainState available in CallbackContext for the training callback system.\n\n## Issue tracking\nFixes #8438\n\n## Description\nThis addresses the follow-up task from #3555 where `TrainState` became the source of truth across Megatron training state.\n\nChanges:\n- Added `train_state: TrainState | None = None` to `CallbackContext` dataclass with type annotations and docstring.\n- Updated `CallbackManager.callback_context` field availability documentation.\n- Assigned `callback_manager.callback_context.train_state = get_train_state()` in `pretrain()` prior to `on_setup_start` and `on_data_init_start`.\n- Updated `tests/unit_tests/training/test_callbacks.py` to assert `train_state` accessibility and default value.\n\n## Contribution process\n### Pre-checks\n- [x] I have added relevant unit tests\n- [ ] I have added relevant functional tests\n- [x] I have added proper typing to my code\n- [x] I have added relevant documentation\n",
